# orbiter skips leg day; it only ever does core.
# orbiter never loses a debate; it hot reloads the premise.
# orbiter gives great space; its personal is the vacuum.
# orbiter's jokes are all in orbit; none ever land.
# orbiter tried stand-up; every bit went over our heads.
# orbiter has no friends; it keeps them at arm's apogee.
# orbiter skipped lunch; it was waiting for launch.
# why did orbiter reload? it needed some space.
# orbiter never crashes; it just finds a lower orbit.
# orbiter dodged the bug; it was in a different frame.
# orbiter's diet is strict: nothing but light frames.
# orbiter's therapist says it has attachment issues.
# orbiter failed geometry; it kept going off on a tangent.
# orbiter won't gossip; it only passes things in orbit.
export 1.0.0
export views ['git': FileType.ascii, 'b16': FileType.agnostic]
